---
/**
 * Risk Reversal — reframes the discovery call as a deliverable, not a sales pitch.
 * "Results in advance" guarantee to remove the last conversion barrier.
 * Positioned after FeaturedTestimonial, before FinalCTA.
 * Hardcoded content — no props needed.
 */
---

<section id="risk-reversal" class="relative not-prose scroll-mt-[72px] bg-section border-y border-primary/5">
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 md:px-6 py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-32 text-center">

    <div class="intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
      <!-- Shield icon -->
      <div class="mx-auto mb-6 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent/15">
        <svg class="h-10 w-10 text-accent" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-default">
        Our guarantee
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 text-xl md:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-default font-heading">
        We'll show you your three biggest data bottlenecks in 30 minutes &mdash;
        whether we work together or not.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">
        No sales pitch. No jargon. Just an honest look at where your business
        is leaking time, money, or both. You'll walk away with a clear picture
        of what to fix first &mdash; and you can take that anywhere.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8">
        <a
          href="/scorecard"
          data-astro-prefetch
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border border-transparent bg-primary px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-primary/90 active:scale-[0.98] active:translate-y-px focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary focus:ring-offset-2"
        >
          Book your free Data Health Check
        </a>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">
          30 minutes. Zero obligation. Real answers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
